<title>JAPAN: Takara Standard -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Takara Standard -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		147.09		vs	  138.22</p>
<p> Operating	   12.45		vs	   10.67</p>
<p> Current	     11.46		vs	   10.27</p>
